message.content:
Insufficient retrieved evidence. The NASA Systems Engineering Handbook refers to NPR 1441.1, NASA Records Retention Schedules, for requirements on the retention period of configuration-status accounting records, but does not specify an exact universal number of years within the handbook itself.

Claims:
- Sổ tay không nêu rõ số năm lưu trữ hồ sơ kế toán trạng thái cấu hình, mà dẫn chiếu đến NPR 1441.1 để xác định thời hạn lưu trữ.  
  - Citations:
    - {source_id: "NASA-SE:p0161", locator: "section/paragraph '6.6 Technical Data Management'", evidence: "retention of appropriate technical, to include mission and science, data beyond system retirement as required by NPR 1441.1, NASA Records Retention Schedules."}
    - {source_id: "NASA-SE:p0276", locator: "section/paragraph 'Section 6.6 Technical Data Management'", evidence: "NPR 1441.1, NASA Records Retention Schedules"}
    - {source_id: "NASA-SE:p0292", locator: "Procedural Requirements", evidence: "NPR 1441.1, NASA Records Retention Schedules"}
